cff-version: 1.2.0
title: street-fighter-alpha-2-nochip
message: >-
  If you use this work, or the measurements it publishes, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/street-fighter-alpha-2-nochip
url: https://github.com/gufranco/street-fighter-alpha-2-nochip
abstract: >-
  Rebuilds Street Fighter Alpha 2 for the Super Nintendo without its S-DD1
  decompressor, expanding every compressed stream ahead of time so the cartridge
  needs no coprocessor. The retail dump is the only authority: every stream is
  located, decoded and checked against a decompressor held to an independent
  encoder, and every dump the build reads is confirmed against a published digest
  before a byte of it is used.
keywords:
  - super-nintendo
  - street-fighter-alpha-2
  - s-dd1
  - rom-hacking
  - decompression
  - conformance
license: MIT
